{"title":"Red Dragon","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 70 Dragon that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: breath: {\n            shape: {\n                kind: \"cone\",\n                rangeTiles: 6,\n                halfAngle: De\n            },\n            inhaleMs: 1e3,\n            cooldownMs: 12e3,\n            damageMult: 1.4\n        } | strafe: {\n            shape: {\n                kind: \"line\",\n                length: 8,\n                halfWidth: .75\n            },\n            inhaleMs: 1e3,\n            cooldownMs: 3e4,\n            damageMult: 1.4,\n            airborne: !0\n        }</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/ember-gland\">Ember Gland</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/red-dragon\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/red-dragon?lv=60\">Lv 60 <span>65</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/red-dragon?lv=70\">Lv 70</a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/red-dragon?lv=60\" title=\"Pick level 60\"><td><b>60</b></td><td>455</td><td>37.5</td><td>3,000</td><td class=\"muted\">1,365 · 52.5 · 9,000</td><td>65</td><td>in the wilds around 2247, 490</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/red-dragon?lv=70\" title=\"Pick level 70\"><td><b>70</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>525</td><td>43</td><td>3,500</td><td class=\"muted\">1,575 · 60.2 · 10,500</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 8 recorded drops, 1,746 total, 179–242 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×179–242</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragon-fang\" title=\"Dragon Fang - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 2 total, 2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2688ac9988cad641486e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragon Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragon-hide\" title=\"Dragon Hide - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9e2b88dfaf721a2d79c9.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragon Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonscale-knick\" title=\"Dragonscale Knick - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/620b30f073ef24409e0d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonscale Knick</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bones\" title=\"Bones - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/c29e1ebe544dbfedca68.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bones</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonscale-arms\" title=\"Dragonscale Arms - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/01655d6cc28367cce40f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonscale Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-5737.5px,-4311.0px)\"><img src=\"tiles/5/21/16.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:5376px;top:4096px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/21/17.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:5376px;top:4352px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/22/16.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:5632px;top:4096px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/22/17.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:5632px;top:4352px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/23/16.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:5888px;top:4096px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/23/17.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:5888px;top:4352px\"><i style=\"left:5737.5px;top:4311.0px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 2256, 491 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"red-dragon\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/embermaw\"><img src=\"data/img/bfbd66309f9f99fae2da.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Embermaw</b><span>Lv 60</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Dragon: <a href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon\">Baby Red Dragon</a> <span class=\"muted\">(55)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/young-red-dragon\">Young Red Dragon</a> <span class=\"muted\">(62)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/bfbd66309f9f99fae2da.webp\" alt=\"Red Dragon\"></div><h3>Red Dragon</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>70 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 0–60)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Dragon</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>525</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>43</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>3500</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.4 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>2.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (14 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>1 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}